evision:4","quote":"SMOKE-r2-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R23）：SGC-R23片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周；剂量递增与安全性暂停规则按方案剂量递增章节执行。","quote_sha256":"6f184f30ecc774ef6a61511138b1fc8f2c2b303c85ddf2f708e2ef29cc17fda3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：安慰剂片外观与SGC-R23一致，口服每日一次×12周；各组按1:1:1:1随机；背景GDMT按指南维持稳定。","quote_sha256":"79bad781c3f4b04970a387e287e330f78ae268f87d896ae3a87cb42c2c525e83","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_05"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_01","es_02","es_04","es_05"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取项目剂量递增章节或剂量调整SOP，确认具体参数后补入正文","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_dose_escalation","missing_source_classes":["剂量递增与安全性暂停规则项目文件"],"target":"剂量递增与安全性暂停规则的具体触发阈值、暂停后恢复条件及永久停药标准"},{"action":"获取项目合并用药清单，将占位标识符替换为具体药物名称后补入正文","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_concomitant_meds","missing_source_classes":["允许/禁止合并治疗具体药物清单"],"target":"允许的合并治疗与禁止的合并治疗具体药物名称或类别"}],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":["剂量递增与安全性暂停规则项目文件","允许/禁止合并治疗具体药物清单"],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，采用平行组分配模型。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至SGC-R23低剂量组（2.5 mg）、SGC-R23中剂量组（5 mg）、SGC-R23高剂量组（10 mg）或安慰剂对照组，共四个治疗组。治疗期为第1天至第12周，受试者每日口服一次研究药物或安慰剂，连续给药12周；治疗结束后进入末次给药后28天的安全性随访期。所有受试者在研究期间维持稳定的指南导向药物治疗，包括ACEI/ARB/ARNI、β受体阻滞剂及有指征时的MRA，背景GDMT按指南维持稳定，不得自行调整。筛选前30天内正在使用或曾使用其他sGC激动剂、PDE5抑制剂或长效硝酸酯类者不得入组。剂量递增与安全性暂停规则按方案剂量递增章节执行。","rationale":"总体治疗框架、四臂设计、1:1:1:1随机比例、12周给药、28天安全性随访、背景GDMT维持及禁止合并用药类别均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。剂量递增与安全性暂停规则的具体参数未在本次来源中给出；允许与禁止合并治疗的具体药物名称以占位标识符出现，尚未展开为可执行清单，需医学经理补充确认。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_630318110422f93b","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b39da155fc46c4928885157c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003141941_73b0283c","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"SMOKE-r2-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R23）：SGC-R23片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周；剂量递增与安全性暂停规则按方案剂量递增章节执行。","quote_sha256":"6f184f30ecc774ef6a61511138b1fc8f2c2b303c85ddf2f708e2ef29cc17fda3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：安慰剂片外观与SGC-R23一致，口服每日一次×12周；各组按1:1:1:1随机；背景GDMT按指南维持稳定。","quote_sha256":"79bad781c3f4b04970a387e287e330f78ae268f87d896ae3a87cb42c2c525e83","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_05"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_04","es_05"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"试验用药品为SMOKE-r2-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R23）薄膜衣片，规格为2.5 mg、5 mg和10 mg，按随机分配确定每位受试者所属剂量组。给药途径为口服，每日一次，连续给药12周。安慰剂为外观与SGC-R23薄膜衣片一致的安慰剂片，口服每日一次，连续给药12周。四个治疗组（SGC-R23低剂量组、SGC-R23中剂量组、SGC-R23高剂量组、安慰剂对照组）按1:1:1:1比例随机分配。背景GDMT按指南维持稳定，不作为试验用药品管理。","rationale":"药物名称、剂型（薄膜衣片）、三个规格（2.5/5/10 mg）、给药频率（每日一次）、治疗周期（12周）、安慰剂外观一致性、四组1:1:1:1随机比例及背景GDMT维持要求均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。安慰剂与活性药外观一致性的具体实现方式及双盲维持措施需药学与临床团队进一步确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_f456748c91c67276","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b39da155fc46c4928885157c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003141941_73b0283c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_07"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_08"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_09"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_10"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究：SGC-R23设低/中/高三个剂量组与安慰剂组平行对照，主要评价12周NT-proBNP较基线变化与安全性及耐受性。","quote_sha256":"28ee1c5d2049e6b8696d6c90f1f6ffacb54fedf472f32b2e109b7303a334414d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_01"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_07","es_08","es_09","es_10","es_01"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取SGC-R23研究者手册及既往研究总结报告，补充机制描述与既往安全性特征","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_611_ib_missing","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床毒理学研究报告","既往人体临床研究安全性数据"],"target":"SGC-R23完整药理作用机制、非临床毒理学数据、既往人体研究安全性数据"}],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床毒理学研究报告","既往人体临床研究安全性数据","完整药理作用机制描述"],"proposal_text":"研究药物SGC-R23为小分子化合物，给药途径为口服，剂型为口服固体制剂（薄膜衣片），发挥全身性系统暴露作用。SGC-R23为可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶（sGC）激动剂，通过激活sGC-cGMP信号通路发挥药理作用。本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，旨在初步评价SGC-R23在慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低）患者中的疗效信号与安全性耐受性。","rationale":"药物技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、系统暴露范围（systemic）及sGC激动剂作用机制类别均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。完整的药理作用机制描述、非临床毒理学数据、既往人体研究安全性数据及研究者手册未在本次允许来源中提供，无法写入具体机制细节、靶点选择性、药代动力学参数或既往安全性特征，需获取IB后补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_f7ff8a3093b526cb","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b39da155fc46c4928885157c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003141941_73b0283c","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advis